{"id":"vod_sn_37276","vodId":"37276","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"拂晓的尤娜","name_cn":"拂晓的尤娜","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/674dc93d9dfcfc3c35496466fc93667b.jpg"},"summary":"尤娜（斋藤千和 配音）是高华国的公主，从小生活在父亲的精心呵护之下，尤娜的性格单纯而又善良。尤娜一直暗恋着堂兄苏芳（小林裕介 配音），苏芳亦对尤娜爱护有加，然而，尤娜的父亲伊尔（赤城进 配音）却十分反对两人的交往。即便如此，尤娜依然无法放弃心中对于苏芳的爱恋，某日，她决定将这感情向父亲倾诉，却因此意外撞破了苏芳将父亲杀死的场面。就这样，尤娜和护卫哈克（前野智昭 配音）踏上了逃亡的旅途。　　忠诚的白龙季夏（森田成一 配音）、外冷内热的青龙弦亚（冈本信彦 配音）、温柔体贴的绿龙翟鹤（诹访部顺一 配音）、可爱的黄龙泽诺（下野紘 配音），只有得到了他们的帮助，尤娜才有可能获得生存的希望。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fkr4w54xuM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kGcAPd3Miw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Vc7UtLQC551/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r912PJVik11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n6HzJAQn2B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YV5EKpd8UF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ahBRz68zFZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/taLBa0Tu1r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9P8CnD2e5D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ujR2bvyh3M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QxLdDVVvvX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wcDGYDvFz81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8Qx1BceH6g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QwcC8eRs6B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name"